1a:["$","p","27",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Mailchimp has evolved from a simple email tool into a full marketing platform with automation, landing pages, and CRM. Its customer journey builder offers pre-built automation templates for common B2B scenarios. The Standard plan at $99/month includes 5,000 contacts and 5 seats. Mailchimp's strength is ease of use and pre-built templates."]}]
1b:["$","p","29",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Best for: Small teams wanting a simple, all-in-one marketing platform."]}]
